Comment: 0,0:22:33.16,0:22:39.72,EDJP,CLOCK,0,0,0,karaoke,とけいの針　ふたりが腕で追いかけっこ
Comment: 0,0:22:40.24,0:22:45.77,EDJP,CLOCK,0,0,0,karaoke,そばにいるのに　寄り添えない
Comment: 0,0:22:46.21,0:22:52.13,EDJP,CLOCK,0,0,0,karaoke,あなたは短針で　わたしは……長針？
Comment: 0,0:22:52.40,0:22:58.96,EDJP,CLOCK,0,0,0,karaoke,少しのふれあい秒針が邪魔する
Comment: 0,0:22:59.09,0:23:03.50,EDJP,RIPPLE,0,0,0,karaoke,涙が頬に落ちた　その波紋
Comment: 0,0:23:03.53,0:23:06.54,EDJP,RIPPLE,0,0,0,karaoke,わたしを目覚めさせた
Comment: 0,0:23:06.63,0:23:08.75,EDJP,RIPPLE,0,0,0,karaoke,書きはじめなくっちゃ
Comment: 0,0:23:08.80,0:23:13.07,EDJP,RIPPLE,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1\-pink}初恋{\k1\-default}の私小説
Comment: 0,0:23:13.68,0:23:17.15,EDJP,DIARY,0,0,0,karaoke,起・承・転・結・序・破・急
Comment: 0,0:23:17.25,0:23:20.81,EDJP,DIARY,0,0,0,karaoke,この恋を紡ぐセオリー
Comment: 0,0:23:20.85,0:23:24.35,EDJP,DIARY,0,0,0,karaoke,呟くように　日記のように
Comment: 0,0:23:24.39,0:23:27.87,EDJP,DIARY,0,0,0,karaoke,言葉が、溢れて
Comment: 0,0:23:27.97,0:23:31.44,EDJP,DIARY,0,0,0,karaoke,起・承・転・結・序・破・急
Comment: 0,0:23:31.50,0:23:35.76,EDJP,DIARY,0,0,0,karaoke,はじめて綴るジュヴナイル
Comment: 0,0:23:36.01,0:23:38.41,EDJP,DIARY,0,0,0,karaoke,今の　わたしの夢よ
Comment: 0,0:23:38.58,0:23:44.36,EDJP,DIARY,0,0,0,karaoke,唯一の読者は、あなた
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,EDCN,,0,0,0,,----------------EDCN--------------
Comment: 0,0:22:33.16,0:22:39.72,EDCN,CLOCKCN,0,0,0,karaoke,时钟的指针  在彼此互相追逐
Comment: 0,0:22:40.24,0:22:45.77,EDCN,CLOCKCN,0,0,0,karaoke,明明近在咫尺  但却触不可及
Comment: 0,0:22:46.21,0:22:52.13,EDCN,CLOCKCN,0,0,0,karaoke,如果你是短针  那我就是……长针？
Comment: 0,0:22:52.40,0:22:58.96,EDCN,CLOCKCN,0,0,0,karaoke,明明跟你只有短暂的相触  秒针却在那里碍事
Comment: 0,0:22:59.09,0:23:03.50,EDCN,RIPPLECN,0,0,0,karaoke,泪水从脸颊滑落  留下的泪痕
Comment: 0,0:23:03.53,0:23:06.54,EDCN,RIPPLECN,0,0,0,karaoke,把我给唤醒了
Comment: 0,0:23:06.63,0:23:08.75,EDCN,RIPPLECN,0,0,0,karaoke,我得开始动笔撰写
Comment: 0,0:23:08.80,0:23:13.07,EDCN,RIPPLECN,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1\-pink}初恋{\k1\-default}的自叙小说
Comment: 0,0:23:13.68,0:23:17.15,EDCN,DIARYCN,0,0,0,karaoke,起·承·转·合·始·中·末
Comment: 0,0:23:17.25,0:23:20.81,EDCN,DIARYCN,0,0,0,karaoke,是编织这份恋情的方法理论
Comment: 0,0:23:20.85,0:23:24.35,EDCN,DIARYCN,0,0,0,karaoke,一边喃喃自语  一边书写日记
Comment: 0,0:23:24.39,0:23:27.87,EDCN,DIARYCN,0,0,0,karaoke,溢于言表
Comment: 0,0:23:27.97,0:23:31.44,EDCN,DIARYCN,0,0,0,karaoke,起·承·转·合·始·中·末
Comment: 0,0:23:31.50,0:23:35.76,EDCN,DIARYCN,0,0,0,karaoke,初次书写这青涩时光
Comment: 0,0:23:36.01,0:23:38.41,EDCN,DIARYCN,0,0,0,karaoke,现在  我梦想里
Comment: 0,0:23:38.58,0:23:44.36,EDCN,DIARYCN,0,0,0,karaoke,唯一的那个读者  就是你
