Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.63,0:00:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,接下来是书籍环节
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.57,0:00:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,今天介绍的书是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.49,0:00:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,『太喜欢哥哥而感到苦恼的妹妹的故事。』
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.76,0:00:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,开始了
Dialogue: 1,0:00:11.82,0:00:13.78,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fay0.03\pos(692.21,176.858)\shad1.5}2018年\N皇Fantasy大赏\N获奖作品
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.82,0:00:13.78,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fay0.03\pos(692.21,176.858)\bord12\blur10}2018年\N皇Fantasy大赏\N获奖作品
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.82,0:00:13.78,Screen2,,0,0,0,,{\fay0.06\pos(917.81,749.658)}新浪潮即将到来
